      "post_id": "28968",
      "author_handle": "GTTkel",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 19 years 1 month ago",
      "body": "As the holidays come to a finish I was wondering what has been the best thing you've all done with your children over the past 6 weeks and what made it so good?\nMine has to be when we went away for the weekend as it was such a change. In the 8 years Steve and I have been together we've never had a holiday,not even a honey moon so it was kind of nice that our first break was a family one with the kids. It was nice for me to be able to enjoy the time and play with the kids and have fun; without all the chores I normally have at home. We went to the beach,the fun park on the rides, Under-water World, to a family fun day with bouncy castles etc. It was good fun with the kids running around the caravan. I came back relaxed too.",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-2614/#28968",
